I left out the `aap:caps/http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, and the fetch would send every customer question to an external host while the output stayed unchanged, so the side effect would be hidden. If the graph grant is extended in a reviewed change, the http-client import and fetch can be added then. The files below implement the node with its two granted capabilities.

